              "text_run": {
                "content": "The minimum confidence score (0.0 to 1.0) that defines \"sufficient match\" for highlighting. Semantic highlighting is applied per item after top-k retrieval—only segments that semantically match the query above this threshold will return highlighted fragments with ",
